 "source_instruction": "please show me a digital camera. my favorite brand is casio, my husnband  told me about model exilim ex-z120 7. is there a batteries included too ? isn't it",
 "query": "I stopped by the community garden on my walk home yesterday, and the raised bed right by the entrance is bursting with sunflowers that are already taller than I am\u2014one of them has a head so big it looks like it\u2019s tilting a little under its own weight, and there were three bumblebees bumping around its petals like they couldn\u2019t decide which spot had the best nectar. A kid from the house down the street was there picking cherry tomatoes off the vine too, and he handed me one that was still warm from the sun, so sweet it tasted like summer concentrated into a little juicy bite. The old guy who tends the herb section gave me a tiny bundle of lemon balm to take home, said if I steep it in cold water with a slice of peach it makes the best afternoon drink for sticky, humid days like we\u2019ve been having lately. I\u2019ve heard digital cameras that come with batteries included work really well for people who don\u2019t want to mess with hunting down extra power packs when they first get it, y\u2019know? I\u2019ve heard the zoom thing that uses actual glass lenses instead of just cropping the picture, not the fake digital kind, works really well too. I\u2019ve heard anything that goes over a bill doesn\u2019t line up with the hard line for how much I\u2019m willing to shell out for this.",
